Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":118,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1905513,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284942,"Name":"Ewoo3513","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1443393670,"LastPoster":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1905513,"PostDate":1443393670,"PostContent":"Anyone ever do the pool side reception?! I will have over 40 guests so we need to have a private...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erinbridget87@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.2.16.131","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1443390958,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Ewoo3513","Id":284942,"Name":"Ewoo3513","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.2.16.131","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79623,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"41c9652348a7a9e938aa5a8f8cc52ef7","RawContent":"Anyone ever do the pool side reception?! I will have over 40 guests so we need to have a private reception. \n\n\nThe reception decor by the pool.. Lights and lanterns... Expensive? \n\n\nJan&#039;s Flowers seems to have better reviews than Tai Flora. Any experiences? How is Jan&#039;s pricing? Bouquets and centerpiece prices would be helpful! \n\n\nHair stylist at Renova Spa- any reccomendations for a stylist?","Attachments":[],"Id":1905513,"PostDate":1443393670,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Anyone ever do the pool side reception?! I will have over 40 guests so we need to have a private reception. <br><br>\nThe reception decor by the pool.. Lights and lanterns... Expensive? <br><br>\nJan's Flowers seems to have better reviews than Tai Flora. Any experiences? How is Jan's pricing? Bouquets and centerpiece prices would be helpful! <br><br>\nHair stylist at Renova Spa- any reccomendations for a stylist?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erinbridget87@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.2.16.131","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1443390958,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Ewoo3513","Id":284942,"Name":"Ewoo3513","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.166.221.27","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79623,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"db86260239fa5008bf8637b7bdf818f8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, Ewoo3513 and Congrats on your July wedding next year in RUI Ocho Rios!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;ve come to the right place to find lots of great resources to help with your planning decisions, so well done on a great start already :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For some added inspiration, here are some magcial wedding beach moments that matter we captured in our beautiful Mayan Riviera - to ramp up your creativity even more......enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Cover Photos Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-atn1\/t31.0-8\/11707991_10153655634389487_1188119404337915805_o.jpg\" alt=\"11707991_10153655634389487_1188119404337\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/t31.0-8\/12052523_10153651584894487_8416377497406796458_o.jpg\" alt=\"12052523_10153651584894487_8416377497406\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/t31.0-8\/11427375_10153408854794487_4566310682341134022_o.jpg\" alt=\"11427375_10153408854794487_4566310682341\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and that your Big Day is everything you envision - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905537,"PostDate":1443440297,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, Ewoo3513 and Congrats on your July wedding next year in RUI Ocho Rios!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You've come to the right place to find lots of great resources to help with your planning decisions, so well done on a great start already <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For some added inspiration, here are some magcial wedding beach moments that matter we captured in our beautiful Mayan Riviera - to ramp up your creativity even more......enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....taken from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cover Photos Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-atn1\/t31.0-8\/11707991_10153655634389487_1188119404337915805_o.jpg\" alt=\"11707991_10153655634389487_1188119404337\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/t31.0-8\/12052523_10153651584894487_8416377497406796458_o.jpg\" alt=\"12052523_10153651584894487_8416377497406\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/t31.0-8\/11427375_10153408854794487_4566310682341134022_o.jpg\" alt=\"11427375_10153408854794487_4566310682341\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and that your Big Day is everything you envision - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.196.44.37","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79623,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d54d75d86740ad67f7a17ec570ed95f8","RawContent":"Hello - I&#039;m getting married next week and Jan&#039;s is doing our arrangements. I reviewed quotes from Jan&#039;s, Tai Flora and Grande and Jan&#039;s was 1\/4 of the price. Their customer service has been outstanding and I feel confident everything will be great. I do still have their catalog with prices if you want to PM me your email address. \n\n\nHappy planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1905637,"PostDate":1443559358,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello - I'm getting married next week and Jan's is doing our arrangements. I reviewed quotes from Jan's, Tai Flora and Grande and Jan's was 1\/4 of the price. Their customer service has been outstanding and I feel confident everything will be great. I do still have their catalog with prices if you want to PM me your email address. <br><br>\nHappy planning!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sandra_co8@icloud.com","IpAddress":"50.162.188.193","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421692870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sandraco8","Id":281796,"Name":"Sandraco8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.42.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79623,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77091dffaa36e5591ade52b8a9b366b8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m a Jamaica bride and used Tai Flora. The site here for the resort we were at was about half and half Jan&#039;s and Tai and it really just seemed to depend on what you wanted. I&#039;ve seen some unfavourable comments about Tai lately and it&#039;s too bad because I had excellent service from them and don&#039;t regret using them at all.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I will say this - people in the wedding business in Jamaica don&#039;t seem to stay put very long and that may be the reason Tai is having customer service issues now. From the time I started to plan until just after we got married in 2011, the resort went through 4 planners and they have all gone to other resorts. I think they just go where they&#039;re getting a better offer.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905644,"PostDate":1443564858,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm a Jamaica bride and used Tai Flora. The site here for the resort we were at was about half and half Jan's and Tai and it really just seemed to depend on what you wanted. I've seen some unfavourable comments about Tai lately and it's too bad because I had excellent service from them and don't regret using them at all.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I will say this - people in the wedding business in Jamaica don't seem to stay put very long and that may be the reason Tai is having customer service issues now. From the time I started to plan until just after we got married in 2011, the resort went through 4 planners and they have all gone to other resorts. I think they just go where they're getting a better offer.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79623","Title":"Riu Ocho Rios 7\/9\/16!","LastPostDate":1443564858},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
