    <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm still coming and really excited!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.12.104","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76cbf0ee3992eea61737668e663b3268","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m in and yes - the location is reserved from 5pm until approximately 10pm. But that&#039;s not carved in stone - we can cancel if we want if someone finds a better location and we can stay longer than 10. I just gave that as a guide.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904693,"PostDate":1442246631,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm in and yes - the location is reserved from 5pm until approximately 10pm. But that's not carved in stone - we can cancel if we want if someone finds a better location and we can stay longer than 10. I just gave that as a guide.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32d0dca31095cb1b6ef835ff25015b43","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"acw271011\"] Sounds great! &amp;nbsp;Thanks for reserving! &amp;nbsp;I will be there around 6 hopefully!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Could you share the address when you have a moment please&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904694,"PostDate":1442246716,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> Sounds great! \u00a0Thanks for reserving! \u00a0I will be there around 6 hopefully!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Could you share the address when you have a moment please\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1421428169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1442083173","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.12.104","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f5edfe209ad25ac6a4529473e5ac883","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh shoot. Sorry. Forgot! lol&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So it&#039;s the old Fionn McCools at 181 University Ave, at the corner of University and Adelaide (north east corner). It&#039;s now called The Merchant. You access the restaurant from inside the building. You can also use the Path following directions towards the Hilton Hotel. I&#039;ve added the Trip Advisor review as well.&amp;nbsp; The phone number in case anyone gets stuck is 416.363.1944&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.ca\/ShowUserReviews-g155019-d8073346-r304140962-The_Merchant-Toronto_Ontario.html&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.ca\/ShowUserReviews-g155019-d8073346-r304140962-The_Merchant-Toronto_Ontario.html&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Looking forward to seeing everyone! We will have one newlywed in the group again - @[member=\"diadiamond\"] will be just back from Cuba so should have plenty to tell us!! lol Then I guess there are a few of us that will be really close to \"leaving\" (me included!). Should be a fun night!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904696,"PostDate":1442247534,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh shoot. Sorry. Forgot! lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So it's the old Fionn McCools at 181 University Ave, at the corner of University and Adelaide (north east corner). It's now called The Merchant. You access the restaurant from inside the building. You can also use the Path following directions towards the Hilton Hotel. I've added the Trip Advisor review as well.\u00a0 The phone number in case anyone gets stuck is 416.363.1944<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.ca\/ShowUserReviews-g155019-d8073346-r304140962-The_Merchant-Toronto_Ontario.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.tripadvis...to_Ontario.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Looking forward to seeing everyone! We will have one newlywed in the group again - @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276748\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276748-diadiamond\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">diadiamond<\/span><\/a> will be just back from Cuba so should have plenty to tell us!! lol Then I guess there are a few of us that will be really close to \"leaving\" (me included!). Should be a fun night!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"665100554c8ca5b378f359672b4e6993","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"acw271011\"] Fabulous! &amp;nbsp;Thank you! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m really excited!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904697,"PostDate":1442247937,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> Fabulous! \u00a0Thank you! \u00a0I'm really excited!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  cla